{"id":"eedc97021295284c","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-btt-ce-boolean-algebra.md","title":"K 的 btt 下集与 c.e. 布尔代数","display":"thm-btt-ce-boolean-algebra — K 的 btt 下集与 c.e. 布尔代数","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-btt-ce-boolean-algebra","aliases":["20-thm-btt-ce-boolean-algebra"],"display":"thm-btt-ce-boolean-algebra — K 的 btt 下集与 c.e. 布尔代数","chapter":"5","section":"5.3.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercises 5.3.15；5.3.17(i)–(ii)","source_printed_pages":[117],"source_pdf_pages":[152],"depends_on":["[[20-df-bounded-truth-table]]","[[20-df-nce]]","[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]","[[20-thm-re-closure]]","[[20-thm-rec-re]]","[[20-df-finite-code]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-btt-ce-boolean-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-btt-ce-boolean-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-btt-ce-boolean-algebra — K 的 btt 下集与 c.e. 布尔代数"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.3.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercises 5.3.15；5.3.17(i)–(ii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>117</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>152</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d12aec25b5426f2f\" href=\"?note=d12aec25b5426f2f\" title=\"20-df-bounded-truth-table\">20-df-bounded-truth-table</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f6085a9e9511e00a\" href=\"?note=f6085a9e9511e00a\" title=\"20-df-nce\">20-df-nce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c6642949679a7c44\" href=\"?note=c6642949679a7c44\" title=\"20-thm-re-closure\">20-thm-re-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"550ce05cba351a42\" href=\"?note=550ce05cba351a42\" title=\"20-thm-rec-re\">20-thm-rec-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 并在补集、有限并和有限交下封闭的最小集合族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DCE}\">\\(\\operatorname{DCE}\\)</span> 表示两个 c.e. 集合之差，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{btt}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{btt}}\\)</span> 采用有限查询范数定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d12aec25b5426f2f\" href=\"?note=d12aec25b5426f2f\" title=\"20-df-bounded-truth-table\">20-df-bounded-truth-table</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f6085a9e9511e00a\" href=\"?note=f6085a9e9511e00a\" title=\"20-df-nce\">20-df-nce</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c6642949679a7c44\" href=\"?note=c6642949679a7c44\" title=\"20-thm-re-closure\">20-thm-re-closure</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"550ce05cba351a42\" href=\"?note=550ce05cba351a42\" title=\"20-thm-rec-re\">20-thm-rec-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B:=\\bigcap\\left\\{\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega):\n\\mathcal E\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\land\n\\forall B,C\\in\\mathcal F\\\n[\\omega\\setminus B\\in\\mathcal F\\land B\\cup C\\in\\mathcal F\\land B\\cap C\\in\\mathcal F]\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal B:=\\bigcap\\left\\{\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega):\n\\mathcal E\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\land\n\\forall B,C\\in\\mathcal F\\\n[\\omega\\setminus B\\in\\mathcal F\\land B\\cup C\\in\\mathcal F\\land B\\cap C\\in\\mathcal F]\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}btt-ce-boolean-algebra}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\in\\mathcal B\\Longleftrightarrow A\\le_{\\mathrm{btt}}K,\\\\\nA\\in\\mathcal B\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\omega\\ \\exists(C_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^m\\\n[\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{DCE}(C_i)\\land A=\\bigcup_{i&lt;m}C_i].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}btt-ce-boolean-algebra}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\in\\mathcal B\\Longleftrightarrow A\\le_{\\mathrm{btt}}K,\\\\\nA\\in\\mathcal B\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\omega\\ \\exists(C_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^m\\\n[\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{DCE}(C_i)\\land A=\\bigcup_{i&lt;m}C_i].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是 c.e. 集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_0,\\ldots,E_{r-1}\">\\(E_0,\\ldots,E_{r-1}\\)</span> 的有限布尔组合。为每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_i\">\\(E_i\\)</span> 固定其到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 的全可计算归约 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_i\">\\(q_i\\)</span>。输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 查询 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(x)=\\{q_i(x):i&lt;r\\}\">\\(Q(x)=\\{q_i(x):i&lt;r\\}\\)</span>，至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 个数；对其所有有限答案模式计算原布尔公式是否为真，把接受模式的完整有限码写入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(x)\">\\(g(x)\\)</span>。相同查询若被重复使用，其答案一致处理，不增加范数。这给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_{\\mathrm{btt}}K\">\\(A\\le_{\\mathrm{btt}}K\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>反向给范数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的归约，按递增次序把完整查询集写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(x)=\\{q_0(x),\\ldots,q_{k(x)-1}(x)\\}\">\\(Q(x)=\\{q_0(x),\\ldots,q_{k(x)-1}(x)\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k(x)\\le n\">\\(k(x)\\le n\\)</span> 可计算。令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_i=\\{x:i&lt;k(x)\\land q_i(x)\\in K\\}\\quad(i&lt;n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_i=\\{x:i&lt;k(x)\\land q_i(x)\\in K\\}\\quad(i&lt;n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这些集合均 c.e.。对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\subseteq\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\(J\\subseteq\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_J\">\\(R_J\\)</span> 是可计算集合，条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\subseteq\\{0,\\ldots,k(x)-1\\}\">\\(J\\subseteq\\{0,\\ldots,k(x)-1\\}\\)</span> 且模式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{q_i(x):i\\in J\\}\">\\(\\{q_i(x):i\\in J\\}\\)</span> 被该输入的真值表接受。于是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A=\\bigcup_{J\\subseteq\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}}\n\\left(R_J\\cap\\bigcap_{i\\in J}E_i\\cap\\bigcap_{i\\notin J}\\overline{E_i}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A=\\bigcup_{J\\subseteq\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}}\n\\left(R_J\\cap\\bigcap_{i\\in J}E_i\\cap\\bigcap_{i\\notin J}\\overline{E_i}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>右端有限布尔组合属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span>。零范数时只有空模式，得到同一公式的可计算特例。</p>\n<p>每一析取项都可写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_J\\setminus V_J\">\\(U_J\\setminus V_J\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_J=R_J\\cap\\bigcap_{i\\in J}E_i\">\\(U_J=R_J\\cap\\bigcap_{i\\in J}E_i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_J=\\bigcup_{i\\notin J}E_i\">\\(V_J=\\bigcup_{i\\notin J}E_i\\)</span>，两者 c.e.；空交取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>、空并取空集。因此布尔组合是有限个 d.c.e. 集合之并。反向每个 c.e. 差及其有限并显然属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span>，完成第二个等价。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 117 / PDF 152；未把此代数扩张为整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_2\">\\(\\Delta_2\\)</span> 族。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-bounded-truth-table","status":"resolved","id":"d12aec25b5426f2f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-bounded-truth-table]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-nce","status":"resolved","id":"f6085a9e9511e00a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-nce]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-one-complete","status":"resolved","id":"de54fb8c1326b2f0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-re-closure","status":"resolved","id":"c6642949679a7c44","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-re-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-rec-re","status":"resolved","id":"550ce05cba351a42","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-rec-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-bounded-truth-table","status":"resolved","id":"d12aec25b5426f2f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bounded-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-nce]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]；see [[20-thm-re-closure]]；see [[20-thm-rec-re]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-nce","status":"resolved","id":"f6085a9e9511e00a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bounded-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-nce]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]；see [[20-thm-re-closure]]；see [[20-thm-rec-re]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-one-complete","status":"resolved","id":"de54fb8c1326b2f0","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bounded-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-nce]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]；see [[20-thm-re-closure]]；see [[20-thm-rec-re]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-re-closure","status":"resolved","id":"c6642949679a7c44","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bounded-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-nce]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]；see [[20-thm-re-closure]]；see [[20-thm-rec-re]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-rec-re","status":"resolved","id":"550ce05cba351a42","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bounded-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-nce]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]；see [[20-thm-re-closure]]；see [[20-thm-rec-re]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bounded-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-nce]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]；see [[20-thm-re-closure]]；see [[20-thm-rec-re]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DCE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_{\\mathrm{btt}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B:=\\bigcap\\left\\{\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega):\n\\mathcal E\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\land\n\\forall B,C\\in\\mathcal F\\\n[\\omega\\setminus B\\in\\mathcal F\\land B\\cup C\\in\\mathcal F\\land B\\cap C\\in\\mathcal F]\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}btt-ce-boolean-algebra}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\in\\mathcal B\\Longleftrightarrow A\\le_{\\mathrm{btt}}K,\\\\\nA\\in\\mathcal B\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\omega\\ \\exists(C_i)_{i<m}\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^m\\\n[\\forall i<m\\ \\operatorname{DCE}(C_i)\\land A=\\bigcup_{i<m}C_i].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"E_0,\\ldots,E_{r-1}","display":false},{"tex":"E_i","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"q_i","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"Q(x)=\\{q_i(x):i<r\\}","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"g(x)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\le_{\\mathrm{btt}}K","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"Q(x)=\\{q_0(x),\\ldots,q_{k(x)-1}(x)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"k(x)\\le n","display":false},{"tex":"E_i=\\{x:i<k(x)\\land q_i(x)\\in K\\}\\quad(i<n).","display":true},{"tex":"J\\subseteq\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R_J","display":false},{"tex":"J\\subseteq\\{0,\\ldots,k(x)-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{q_i(x):i\\in J\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\bigcup_{J\\subseteq\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}}\n\\left(R_J\\cap\\bigcap_{i\\in J}E_i\\cap\\bigcap_{i\\notin J}\\overline{E_i}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"U_J\\setminus V_J","display":false},{"tex":"U_J=R_J\\cap\\bigcap_{i\\in J}E_i","display":false},{"tex":"V_J=\\bigcup_{i\\notin J}E_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_2","display":false}],"bytes":3170,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-415","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-btt-ce-boolean-algebra]] — 章 5；直接提供者 6 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-415","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-btt-ce-boolean-algebra]]"}],"outgoing":["d12aec25b5426f2f","f6085a9e9511e00a","de54fb8c1326b2f0","c6642949679a7c44","550ce05cba351a42","59004ac6d23e86f8"]}